    rdf:value "unfavourable impression. Here is Wilfrid’s account: “Magda quite won everybody – elle va sans dire after all I have told you of her?! – even that confirmed misogynist Nathaniel Wedd!” Wedd didn’t like her  at all , Trevy said. They had told him some of the things she had said, and he began to repeat them, stumbled, blushed, and said he couldn’t go on, they were really  trop fort . Evidently she lacks tact. But then she is so young. However, the general impression was that she was very much in her element in the  Journalia  from which W. is seeking to extricate her. "^^xsd:string ;
